"entity": {
"name": "Avarda Bank AB",
"description": "Avarda Bank AB engages in the provision of banking services. It offers consumer banking services and e-commerce solutions through a proprietary IT platform with a high degree of automation. It operates through the following segments: Consumer Lending, Ecommerce Solutions, and Credit Cards. The Consumer Lending segment offers unsecured consumer loans to creditworthy individuals, the product offering can differ between the various markets and is adjusted according to the specific conditions in each country. The Ecommerce Solutions segment focuses on digital payment solutions, primarily for online retailers. The Credit Cards segment includes credit cards to creditworthy individuals in Germany and Norway. The company was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Boras, Sweden.",
